synopsis: "Ogmios over any Mirage_flow.S, including Solo5 vsock"
description: """
The WebSocket framing and chain-sync logic live in cardano-rpc as a
transport-free state machine; this package owns the socket. Functorising over
Mirage_flow.S rather than an HTTP client is not a preference: the confidential
Solo5 targets forbid NET_BASIC outright, and sptmac has no networking at all,
so vsock is the only transport available there."""
